      "what": "_solo_window and _watched can return ready for an already accepted change. _review then calls _solo unconditionally on readiness, setting facts.solo even when the ordinary acceptance/quorum path already suffices. merge_one selects its solo message first, and warrant.review.merged_how consequently records solo. With this repository solo.window_hours=0, an ordinary accepted change by a pr/acceptor gets this false provenance as soon as its checks complete. A constitutional change backed by author alice and acceptor bob is similarly labeled one model family after 168 h even with its guard MET and both families behind it.",
